menu "Doorboard ESP32 controller"

config DOORBOARD_ENABLE_KNOCK_DETECTION
    bool "Enable piezo knock detection stub"
    default n
    help
        Enables the sensors task ADC threshold stub that emits knock_event frames.
        Pattern matching is intentionally deferred to a later task.

config DOORBOARD_LED_BRIGHTNESS_PCT
    int "Global LED brightness (percent)"
    range 1 100
    default 60
    help
        Scales every frame the effects library renders. Sixteen WS2812 pixels at
        full white draw about 1 A from the LED rail and are blinding in a dark
        hallway; 60 percent keeps the ring readable without either. Colours in
        docs/hardware/effects-catalog.md are listed at 100 percent.

endmenu
